I agree with the other author that polypiling for a wand of death is a
futile endeavor;  the odds of success are low and will require a great
deal of time.

Here are my suggestions:

1.  Get scrolls of gold detection.  You will need these to survive the
endgame planes.
2.  Do you have a magic marker?  Then try this:
        A)  Find a spellbook, any spellbook.
        B) Dip it in water until its blank.
         C) Now use your magic marker on the now blank spellbook.
Write a book of finger of death.   Now read the FOD spell. Presto,
your instant death capabilities are
restored!   Since you are a wizard and you've already read the book
once,  your chances of doing this should be very close to 100%.


Alternate suggestion:

Do you have a ring of poly control? I forget what gender your character
is, but if it's a female, consider polying into a female cockatrice and
laying a bunch of stone grenades using the #sit command.   Then when
Rodney shows up,  chuck one at him, then deface his statue.

Yes, this will cost you luck, so it's a last resort sort of thing.
But it is possible.  


